"text\": \"We can export videos in multiple aspect ratios for our clients (9:16, 1:1, 16:9, etc.) and upload these to a cloud-based drive or project management system of your choice for easy access and use by your content or social media team.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What Video Formats Do You Use?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"The majority of videos are exported in MP4 unless otherwise requested by our clients.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How much to charge for social media video production?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"The cost will vary depending on the amount of content needed, but the good news is we have different packages available, giving you access to a team of designers. Our 'basic subscription' plan is perfectly suited to businesses wanting to grow their presence on social media.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"I am still not sure if this is right for me, can we discuss it first?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Of course. We encourage you to book a call to discuss your project. The other option is that you can request a video sample and include information on the style you want to achieve, and our team will create a video sample for your social media.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Why should I create effective branded motion graphics for my social media channels?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Branded motion graphics are easy to reuse and provide consistency. They can be used across a variety of video editing software and allow you to maintain a strong visual identity even when using different editors.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How can creating motion graphics for social media benefit my business's online presence?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"By having a clear identity and reusable assets, it allows you to create content at scale and have multiple people, both in-house and outsourced, creating video content that is cohesive and aligns with your brand.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n  \"name\": \"VidIQ Social Media Video — Motion The Agency\",\n  \"description\": \"Social media video produced by Motion The Agency for VidIQ.\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"../videos/VidIQ-poster-00001.jpg\",\n  \"uploadDate\": \"2024-12-04T17:15:11+00:00\",\n  \"duration\": \"PT17S\",\n  \"contentUrl\": \"../videos/VidIQ-transcode.mp4\",\n  \"publisher\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n    \"name\": \"Motion The Agency\",\n    \"logo\": {\n      \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n      \"url\": \"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66ebfb6ec8f20d5eda50eb34/6762c1dea24d4f98491f457f_Logo.png\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n  <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Social Media Video Production Services | Motion The Agency\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Create scroll-stopping social media videos with Motion The Agency. From short-form ads to brand stories, we craft content that connects and converts.\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66ebfb6ec8f20d5eda50eb34/670cc171a0c8c36348181481_UI%20Animation%20Thumbnail.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">",
    "bodyEnd": "\n<!--  Slick Slider JS  -->\n  <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.min.js\"></script>\n  <!--  Card Slider Config  -->\n  <script>\n    $(document).ready(function() {\n        //-------- Filter functionality ----------\n        // Add class name of category slug to each slider item\n        $('.card-slider_item').addClass(function() {\n            return $(this).find('.card-category_slug').text() //class of element hidden in slider collection with category slug\n        });\n        // When you click a dropdown link, filter the slider\n        $(\".dropdown-link\").click(function() {\n            if ($(this).hasClass(\"cc-selected\")) { //if the dropdown link is already selected, unselect and unfilter the slider\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickUnfilter');\n                $(this).removeClass(\"cc-selected\");\n            } else { //if the dropdown link isn't selected, add selected class and filter the slider\n                $(\".dropdown-link\").removeClass(\"cc-selected\");\n                $(this).addClass(\"cc-selected\");\n                var filter = $(this).find('.dropdown-link_slug').text(); //class of element hidden in dropdown link with category slug\n                var filterClass = '.' + filter; //add '.' before slug name to associate it as a class\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickUnfilter'); //clear previous filter on slider\n                $(\"#cms-slider\").slick('slickFilter', filterClass); //filter the slider by the selected dropdown link's slug\n            }\n        });\n        //-------- Configure slider ----------\n        $('#cms-slider').slick({\n            arrows: false,\n            infinite: false,\n            autoplay: false,\n            autoplaySpeed: 8000,\n            speed: 300,\n            slidesToShow: 3,\n            slidesToScroll: 1,\n            responsive: [{\n                    breakpoint: 1024,\n                    settings: {\n                        slidesToShow: 2\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    breakpoint: 768,\n                    settings: {\n                        slidesToShow: 1\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        });\n        //--------- Set custom nav ---------\n        $('#cms-slider-right').click(function() {\n            $('#cms-slider').slick('slickNext');\n        });\n        $('#cms-slider-left').click(function() {\n            $('#cms-slider').slick('slickPrev');\n        });\n    });\n</script>\n  ",
    "bodyStart": "<script>document.body.className=\"body\";</script>"
  }
};
